<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 234 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 234 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 234 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID    AMOUNT		INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 44	 44			9.00 pct</p>
<p>    Five years     20	 20		     10.00 pct</p>
<p>    10 years	 20	 20		     10.25 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	150	150		     10.50 pct</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   234	234</p>
<p>($1= 8.8 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
